OL,4,CDrug rape husband says wife 'would     
OL,5,Chave been terrified', court hears      
OL,6,GA husband who admits drugging and      
OL,7,Graping his wife with strangers has     
OL,8,Gtold a court that if she had woken     
OL,9,Gduring the abuse, she would have been  
OL,10,G"terrified".                           
OL,12,FThe defendant, who has admitted        
OL,13,Fmultiple sexual offences dating back   
OL,14,Fto 2004, said he drugged his wife so   
OL,15,Fshe would be unaware of the abuse by   
OL,16,Fhim and other men.                     
OL,22,                                   G1/4 
