OL,4,CTate Liverpool to reopen in autumn 2027
OL,5,GTate Liverpool is expected to reopen   
OL,6,Gin autumn 2027 after a #30m            
OL,7,Gtransformation.                        
OL,9,FThe gallery at Royal Albert Dock       
OL,10,Fclosed in October 2023 for a major     
OL,11,Fredevelopment project. It had          
OL,12,Foriginally been due to reopen in 2025, 
OL,13,Fbut funding delays pushed back the     
OL,14,Ftimetable.                             
OL,16,FTate Liverpool said its reopening      
OL,17,Fprogramme would begin with a major     
OL,18,Fsurrealism exhibition featuring works  
OL,19,Fby Salvador Dali, Eileen Agar and Man  
OL,20,FRay.                                   
OL,22,                                   G2/4 
