OL,4,CEx-principal banned over sex with      
OL,5,Cformer student                         
OL,6,GA former acting principal has been     
OL,7,Gbanned from teaching for life over an  
OL,8,Ginappropriate relationship with a      
OL,9,Gvulnerable student which became sexual 
OL,10,Gafter she left college.                
OL,12,FA Teaching Regulation Agency panel     
OL,13,Ffound Peter Roberts, 59, crossed       
OL,14,Fprofessional boundaries while the      
OL,15,Fstudent was still at Oldham Sixth Form 
OL,16,FCollege in Greater Manchester.         
OL,18,FRoberts admitted the conduct but       
OL,19,Fdisputed that all of it was sexually   
OL,20,Fmotivated.                             
OL,22,                                   G3/4 
