OL,4,CNuclear test veterans investigation 'a 
OL,5,Cwatershed moment'                      
OL,6,GAn academic who has worked with        
OL,7,Gnuclear test veterans and their        
OL,8,Gfamilies said an independent           
OL,9,Ginvestigation into their experiences   
OL,10,Gis a "watershed moment".               
OL,12,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham has        
OL,13,Fannounced an investigation into the    
OL,14,Fhealth legacy of Britain's Cold War-   
OL,15,Fera atomic programme and ordered an    
OL,16,Findependent panel to assess the        
OL,17,Fpotential impact of testing exercises  
OL,18,Fin the 1950s and 1960s.                
OL,22,                                   G4/4 
